@*
    The SecretariArt logo (Quill, Nov 2026): a quill icon with the wordmark "Secretari" (italic) "Art" (bold, amber).
    This is the version for the violet backgrounds it sits on (navigation bar, sign-in page); the one-colour and
    light-background versions live in the logo project, for print. The link around it carries the name for screen
    readers, so the drawing itself is hidden from them.
*@
<span class="brand-logo">
    <svg class="brand-quill" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <path d="M53 7C33 11 19 29 17 51c12-9 27-22 36-44z" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="5" />
        <path d="M17 51L42 20" stroke="#f2a541" stroke-width="4" />
        <path d="M17 51l-4 6" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="5" />
        <path d="M24 58h30" stroke="#f2a541" stroke-width="5" />
    </svg>
    <span class="brand-wordmark"><span class="brand-secretari">Secretari</span><span class="brand-art">Art</span></span>
</span>
